<title>USA: Famous Dave's to open its third eatery.</title>
<headline>Famous Dave's to open its third eatery.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Famous Dave's of America Inc said Thursday it will open a new restaurant in the third quarter of 1997 on property it leased in Forest Lake, Minnesota.</p>
<p>The new restaurant, with seating for 100 to 120 people, will be the third roadhouse-style barbecue eatery in its chain in the Twin Cities area, the company said.</p>
<p>Famous Dave's shares closed up 1/16 Thursday at 7-1/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
